---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      <!-- 品牌介绍与 Bing 优化导语 -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-sky-200">
            梯
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">2027梯子推荐 · tizituijian2027.blog</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          专注于 2027 年最新科学上网梯子评测与翻墙代理节点排行榜。我们坚持以真实晚高峰压测、全内网 IEPL 专线抗封锁指标为核心，为跨境电商、外贸办公、流媒体追剧及海外 AI 开发者提供客观、中立、防跑路的梯子选购指南。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-sky-700 font-medium">
            IEPL 国际专线
          </span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-emerald-700 font-medium">
            4K / 8K 秒开
          </span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-indigo-700 font-medium">
            ChatGPT 原生解锁
          </span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-amber-700 font-medium">
            Hysteria 2 弱网加速
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 快速导航 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm mb-3">核心专题</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ranking/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">2027 优质梯子排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">梯子参数与测速横向对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/scenarios/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">多场景梯子挑选指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/clients/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">Windows/Mac/iOS/安卓配置教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">梯子常见疑问 FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 友情链接与规范 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm mb-3">关于与合规</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">关于本站与实测原则</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">梯子深度评测文章</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap/" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">HTML 全站网站地图</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap.xml" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">XML Sitemap 站点地图</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">Sitemap Index 索引</a></li>
          <li><a href="/e9a8f273b1454c5e89d14f2a781290bc.txt" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">Bing IndexNow 验证</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部版权与免责声明 -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
      <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
        <p>© 2026-2027 tizituijian2027.blog. 保留所有权利。</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-500">
          免责声明：本站所有评测内容与网络加速测试仅供网络科研、外贸跨境、学术文献查阅及正规学习交流使用。严禁使用任何翻墙加速工具从事违反所在地法律法规的活动。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500">
        <span>关键词：2027梯子推荐</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>微软 Bing 搜索收录优化</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
